OL,3,ASpain announces new housing measures
OL,4,Aafter protests over 87-year-old woman's
OL,5,Aeviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe said the measures would bring
OL,8,Frelief to more than five million people
OL,9,F- but opposition politician Miriam
OL,10,FNogueras said the agreement left "small
OL,11,Flandlords out in the cold".
OL,13,FThe new housing measures need to be
OL,14,Fapproved in parliament, where the
OL,15,Fleftist coalition government lacks a
OL,16,Fmajority.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
